[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was merged as one issue and closed on 5 October. Its reports hold three
problems. The desk merged them on subject line ([decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject)),
and all three write the same subjects. Each one has a ticket of its own.

